# Pearls Culinary Counts — Environment Configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stage 1 Frontend Architecture Note:
# This project in Stage 1 operates as a static client-side single-page application (SPA).
# No secret API keys (Gemini, Paystack secret keys, or database passwords) are used or
# required in the client-side bundle. All customer enquiries route safely via WhatsApp.
#
# Server-side environment variables will be introduced in Stage 2 with backend activation.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Reserved for optional future server-side AI features in Stage 2.
# Platform automatically provides this if server-side Gemini integration is activated.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# APP_URL: The public URL where this web application is hosted.
APP_URL=

